# Coordination service origin.
#
# NOTE: do NOT include /v1 — the SDK's documented paths (session-protocol §4.2)
# already carry it, so a base of `https://host` and `https://host/` behave
# identically and neither should append the version.
#
# Anything VITE_-prefixed is inlined into the client bundle and is therefore
# PUBLIC. Never put a secret here.
#
# The browser must trust the coordination cert's CA before any call succeeds.
# It is signed by a local CA (`sentry-core/tls/ca.crt`, CN=Kallon Sentry Local
# CA) and the URL must match a SAN on it — an IP, not a hostname. Visit
# <url>/healthz once and click through, or install ca.crt into the OS trusted
# root store. A bare "Failed to fetch" with NO HTTP status is this, not a bug.
VITE_COORDINATION_URL=https://192.168.1.230:8081
